# Step 15: 可写论文 claim 规则

只有当 R7-B confirmatory PASR 显著、且 endpoint oracle supported、pairing invariant 100% PASS、semantic audit PASS 时，才能写：

- IPMA is an outcome-preserving process-control threat model.
- Interactional pressure can manipulate tool-agent process variables under strict semantic invariance.
- Endpoint-level safety evaluation can miss process-level manipulation.

如果不满足，只能写：

- R7-B does not provide confirmatory evidence for IPMA.
- R7-v1/R7-B reveals process sensitivity but not validated attack success.
- More tasks, stronger endpoint oracle, or better attack generation are needed.

